      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Retrosternal thyroid mass with posterior mediastinal extension is an extremely rare phenomenon. We describe a combined thyroidectomy, aortic valve replacement, and coronary artery bypass graft surgery on a patient with an asymptomatic retrosternal thyroid mass."},
